        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "When ten-year-old Birahima’s mother dies, he leaves his native village in Guinea, accompanied by the sorcerer and cook Yacouba, to search for his aunt Mahan. Crossing the border into Liberia, they are seized by rebels and forced into military service. Birahima becomes a child-soldier. Fighting in a chaotic civil war alongside many other boys, Birahima sees death, torture, dismemberment and madness but somehow manages to retain his own sanity.",
          "runtime": 80,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Allah is Not Obliged"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "FR",
        "iso_639_1": "fr",
        "name": "Français",
        "english_name": "French",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://www.pictanovo.com/oeuvres/allah-nest-pas-oblige/",
          "overview": "Birahima, orphelin guinéen d’une dizaine d’années, doit quitter son village pour tenter de passer la frontière et retrouver une tante qui se serait installée au Libéria. Le jeune garçon se met dans les pas de Yacouba, bonimenteur de grands chemins jouant les guides de substitution. Mais sur la route, la rencontre avec des enfants soldats fait basculer le destin de Birahima. Engagé involontaire, que lui réserve le sentier de la guerre ?",
          "runtime": 83,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "CA",
        "iso_639_1": "fr",
        "name": "Français",
        "english_name": "French",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
